<figure class="termio-map" aria-labelledby="termio-map-title">
  <figcaption id="termio-map-title"><span>BYTE OWNERSHIP</span><strong>Termio keeps syscall chunks out of the protocol contract</strong></figcaption>
  <ol>
    <li><b>Child shell</b><code>ready&gt;</code><span>blocks waiting for input</span></li>
    <li><b>PTY master</b><code>3 bytes · 3 bytes</code><span>read boundaries are arbitrary</span></li>
    <li class="owner"><b>Termio</b><code>readUntil("ready&gt;")</code><span>owns PTY + child + phase buffer</span></li>
    <li class="owner"><b>Termio</b><code>writeAll("hello\n")</code><span>writes while session remains alive</span></li>
    <li><b>PTY master</b><code>echo + ESC [ 32 m …</code><span>opaque bytes, not styled text yet</span></li>
    <li><b>Child exit</b><code>wait → 0</code><span>Termio closes the session</span></li>
  </ol>
</figure>
<style>
